const customSourceKinds={external:'Raccourci',mediawiki:'MediaWiki',json:'API JSON'},customSourceDomains={general:'Généraliste',science:'Sciences & Santé',culture:'Culture & Médias',technology:'Technologie',nature:'Nature & Environnement',society:'Société & Monde',leisure:'Loisirs & Jeux'};
let sourceAnalysis=null;const sourceUrlInput=$('#customSourceEndpoint'),sourceUrlRow=document.createElement('div');sourceUrlRow.className='custom-source-url-row';sourceUrlInput.before(sourceUrlRow);sourceUrlRow.append(sourceUrlInput);let analyzeSourceButton=document.createElement('button');analyzeSourceButton.id='analyzeCustomSource';analyzeSourceButton.type='button';analyzeSourceButton.title='Analyser le site et rechercher ses flux RSS';analyzeSourceButton.setAttribute('aria-label',analyzeSourceButton.title);const analyzerIcon='<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="6"></circle><path d="m14.5 14.5 5 5M7 10h6M10 7v6"></path></svg>';analyzeSourceButton.innerHTML=analyzerIcon;sourceUrlRow.append(analyzeSourceButton);
analyzeSourceButton.onclick=async()=>{
  let url=sourceUrlInput.value.trim(),message=$('#customSourceMessage');
  if(!url){message.className='error';message.textContent='Indiquez d’abord l’adresse du site.';return}
  analyzeSourceButton.disabled=true;analyzeSourceButton.classList.add('analyzing');message.className='';message.textContent='FitSearch examine la page et vérifie les flux annoncés.';
  let f=new FormData();f.append('url',url);
  try{
    let data=await (await fetch('/api/custom-sources/analyze',{method:'POST',body:f})).json();if(!data.ok)throw new Error(data.error||'Analyse impossible');sourceAnalysis=data;
    let rss=data.has_valid_feed?`<div class="analysis-rss valid"><b>Flux RSS/Atom validé</b>${data.feed_checks.filter(item=>item.valid).map(item=>`<span>${esc(item.kind)} · ${esc(item.url)}</span>`).join('')}</div>`:`<div class="analysis-rss absent"><b>Aucun flux RSS/Atom valide détecté</b><span>La recherche interne reste utilisable si elle a été reconnue.</span></div>`;
    $('#sourceAnalysisTitle').textContent=data.compatible?'Source compatible':'Configuration non détectée';
    $('#sourceAnalysisContent').innerHTML=`<div class="analysis-summary"><span><b>Nom proposé</b><strong>${esc(data.name)}</strong></span><span><b>Méthode</b><strong>${esc(data.method)}</strong></span><span><b>Adresse proposée</b><strong>${esc(data.endpoint)}</strong></span><span><b>Catégorie</b><strong>${esc(customSourceDomains[data.domain]||data.domain)}</strong></span><span><b>Compatibilité</b><strong>${esc(data.confidence)}</strong></span></div><p class="analysis-message">${esc(data.message)}</p>${rss}`;
    $('#applySourceAnalysis').hidden=!data.compatible;$('#sourceAnalysisDialog').showModal();message.textContent='Analyse terminée.'
  }catch(error){message.className='error';message.textContent=error.message}
  finally{analyzeSourceButton.disabled=false;analyzeSourceButton.classList.remove('analyzing');analyzeSourceButton.innerHTML=analyzerIcon}
};
